msgstr "Bîr têra tomarkirinê nake, hin gavan jêbibin da cih di bîrê de çêbibe"

#: gdk-pixbuf/io-jpeg.c:568 gdk-pixbuf/io-jpeg.c:781
#, c-format
msgid "Unsupported JPEG color space (%s)"
